Load venomous ammunition, causing ranged attacks to deal [0.96, 1.47, 2.32, 3.19, 4.06 (PP 10-100)] nature damage and inflict numbing poison, dealing [4.81, 7.33, 12, 16, 20 (PP 10-100)] nature damage over 5 turns and reducing all damage dealt by 5%.

The damage will scale with your Physical Power.
